    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "fclose — close a stream",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_138_02\" id=\"tag_17_138_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdio.h.html\">stdio.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint fclose(FILE *</tt><i>stream</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_138_03\" id=\"tag_17_138_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]fclose[/I5]() function shall cause the stream pointed to by [I6]stream[/I6] to be flushed and the associated file to be\nclosed. Any unwritten buffered data for the stream shall be written to the file; any unread buffered data shall be discarded.\nWhether or not the call succeeds, the stream shall be disassociated from the file and any buffer set by the [A7][I8]setbuf[/I8]()[/A7] or [A9][I10]setvbuf[/I10]()[/A9] function shall be\ndisassociated from the stream. If the associated buffer was automatically allocated, it shall be deallocated.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A7": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/setbuf.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A9": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/setvbuf.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S11][[A12]CX[/A12]][/S11] [IMG13] If\nthe file is not already at EOF, and the file is one capable of seeking, the file offset of the underlying open file description\nshall be set to the file position of the stream if the stream is the active handle to the underlying file description.",
    "placeholders": {
     "S11": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A12": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG13": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The [I14]fclose[/I14]() function shall mark for update the last data modification and last file status change timestamps of the\nunderlying file, if the stream was writable, and if buffered data remains that has not yet been written to the file. The\n[I15]fclose[/I15]() function shall perform the equivalent of a [A16][I17]close[/I17]()[/A16] on the file\ndescriptor that is associated with the stream pointed to by [I18]stream[/I18]. [IMG19]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A16": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/close.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG19": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "After the call to [I20]fclose[/I20](), any use of [I21]stream[/I21] results in undefined behavior.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I21": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00010",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A22][/A22]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A22": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_138_04\" id=\"tag_17_138_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
