    "id": "p_00041",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Use of [A105][I106]freopen[/I106]()[/A105] to change [I107]stdin[/I107], [I108]stdout[/I108], or [I109]stderr[/I109] instead\nof closing them avoids the danger of a file unexpectedly being opened as one of the special file descriptors STDIN_FILENO,\nSTDOUT_FILENO, or STDERR_FILENO at a later time in the application.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A105": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/freopen.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I106": {
      "open": "<i>",
